oid/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/input/GodotInputHandler.java#L423-L486\r\n\r\n05-01 10:35:57.079 13964 13964 D GodotInputHandler: getGodotButton: 82\r\n05-01 10:35:57.246 13964 13964 D GodotInputHandler: getGodotButton: 82\r\n05-01 10:35:57.835 13964 13964 D GodotInputHandler: getGodotButton: 4\r\n05-01 10:35:57.898 13964 13964 D GodotInputHandler: getGodotButton: 4\r\n\r\nThis is what I get from my branch via adding the logger here \r\n```\r\n\tpublic static int getGodotButton(int keyCode) {\r\n\t\tLog.d(TAG, \"getGodotButton: \" + keyCode);\r\n\t\tint button;\r\n\t\tswitch (keyCode) {\r\n\t\t\tcase KeyEvent.KEYCODE_BUTTON_A: // Android A is SNES B\r\n```\r\n\t\t\t\r\ndo you want me to test without my changes as well?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845090966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845103482","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105972#issuecomment-2845103482","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105972","id":2845103482,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6plNV6","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url"