"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T16:02:58Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T16:02:58Z","body":"> Do you want me to update the PR Commit?\r\n\r\nyes but you still have to familiarize yourself with it and it should be \"master\" branch\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/workflow/pr_workflow.html\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ae5aafa-0824-4ab4-aab6-c36506d82c69)\r\n\r\n\r\nbetter:\r\n\r\n```java\r\ncase KeyEvent.KEYCODE_BUTTON_START: \r\ncase KeyEvent.KEYCODE_BUTTON_MENU: \r\n \t\t\tbutton = 6; \r\n \t\t\tbreak; \r\n```\r\n\r\nthe comments are probably not necessary, we'll see later\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845142143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845157872","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105972#issuecomment-2845157872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105972","id":2845157872,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6planw","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T16:10:07Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T16:10:57Z","body":"> > Do you want me to update the PR Commit?\r\n> \r\n> yes but you still have to familiarize yourself with it and it should be \"master\" branch\r\n> \r\n> https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/workflow/pr_workflow.html\r\n> \r\n> ![image](https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/41921395/439646708-9ae5aafa-0824-4ab4-aab6-c36506d82c69.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..hnJ0aCAJAoZxd1-baljTax2GzxAeAhl2oHIGuOuUYPk)\r\n> \r\n> better:\r\n> \r\n> ```java\r\n> case KeyEvent.KEYCODE_BUTTON_START: \r\n> case KeyEvent.KEYCODE_BUTTON_MENU: \r\n>  \t\t\tbutton = 6; \r\n>  \t\t\tbreak; \r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> the comments are probably not necessary, we'll see later\r\n\r\nok I've cleaned this up to follow that code pattern instead putting both the button 4 and 6 cases together. \r\n```\r\n\t\t\tcase KeyEvent.KEYCODE_BUTTON_SELECT:\r\n\t\t\tcase KeyEvent.KEYCODE_BACK:\r\n\t\t\t\tbutton = 4;\r\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t\tcase KeyEvent.KEYCODE_BUTTON_START:\r\n\t\t\tcase KeyEvent.KEYCODE_MENU:\r\n\t\t\t\tbutton = 6;\r\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\r\n```\r\nI can update this PR and stash the changes for a PR to master. Should this be easily cherry picked though since there are no diffs between the two?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845157872/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845215334","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105972#issuecomment-2845215334","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105972","id":2845215334,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6plopm","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T16:40:24Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T16:43:42Z","body":"PR for Master - https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105992\r\nThanks very much for guiding me through the elegant solution here @Alex2782 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845215334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":